		"description": {
			"value": "<p><strong>Reaction</strong></p><p><em>Trigger: the [[lookup @name lowercase]] is hit by a ranged weapon attack.</em></p><ul><li><p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]] deflects or catches the missile. The damage it takes from the attack is reduced by [[/damage activity=dnd5eactivity000]]. If the damage is reduced to 0, it catches the projectile (such as an arrow or stone).</p></li></ul>",
